      "Turbocharger actuator, boost-control, or charge-air-system issues can cause flatter response, warning lights, or inconsistent torque delivery.",
      "48V mild-hybrid support components such as the starter-generator support hardware, DC/DC integration, or related control strategy can add complexity compared with a conventional petrol drivetrain.",
