        "specialFeature": "This softer fleet-oriented M264.920 calibration keeps the newer facelift mild-hybrid and turbocharged hardware benefits while reducing the sense of reserve torque and overall drivetrain urgency. The result is a more work-focused version of the same modern E 200 petrol architecture."
