        "specialFeature": "M274.920 E 300 factory calibration. This version uses the same fundamental 2.0-liter direct-injection turbo architecture as the lower-tuned M274 variants, but the stronger 245 hp / 370 Nm factory output gives the pre-facelift W213 a genuinely effortless mainstream petrol character. Twin-scroll turbocharging, direct injection, and modern ignition control together make it one of the strongest early W213 non-AMG four-cylinder petrol setups."
