        "intakePortFlow": "DOHC 16-valve head with port geometry shaped for efficient turbocharged road-car airflow rather than naturally aspirated top-end emphasis.",
        "valveSizes": "Verify by exact head revision; the design emphasis is efficient forced-induction flow balance.",
        "valveStemDiameter": "Application-dependent OE specification.",
        "camshaftDuration": "Variable timing behavior on both sides, coordinated by modern engine management for torque, emissions, and drivability.",
        "lifterType": "Hydraulic lash-compensation architecture suitable for premium daily-use refinement.",
        "specialFeature": "North American M274.920 E 300 factory calibration. This version keeps the same strong 2.0-liter direct-injection turbo architecture as the main pre-facelift E 300, but with a slightly different market-specific emissions tune. The real-world character remains broad-torque, smooth, and naturally suited to the W213 platform."
