        "intakePortFlow": "DOHC 16-valve head with ports shaped for efficient turbocharged road-car airflow rather than naturally aspirated top-end emphasis.",
        "valveSizes": "Verify by exact head revision; the design emphasis is efficient forced-induction flow balance.",
