        "specialFeature": "48V EQ Boost integration with the M264 gives the facelift E 300 a cleaner low-speed response and smoother transient behavior than the older M274-based E 300. The stronger factory calibration and hybrid support make it one of the most polished four-cylinder petrol W213 drivetrains."
