        "rodBoltSize": "OE torque-to-yield hardware; replace where factory procedure requires it.",
        "crankMainJournal": "Verify by exact crankshaft revision and service data.",
        "crankRodJournal": "Verify by exact crankshaft revision and service data.",
        "rodRatio": "Modern long-stroke turbo-four geometry focused on usable torque, efficiency, and emissions compliance."
