        "intakePortFlow": "DOHC 24-valve diesel head design focused on torque, efficient airflow, and stable drivability rather than high-rpm power.",
        "valveSizes": "Verify by exact head revision; design emphasis is efficient diesel breathing and combustion control.",
        "valveStemDiameter": "Application-dependent OE specification.",
        "camshaftDuration": "Diesel-oriented camshaft behavior coordinated for torque and drivability rather than top-end power.",
        "lifterType": "Hydraulic lash-compensation architecture suitable for premium diesel refinement.",
        "specialFeature": "Early Euro 5 OM642 configuration using piezo-injector technology and the 231 hp / 540 Nm factory calibration."
