      "blockDesign": "State-of-the-art inline 6-cylinder all-aluminum block featuring Nanoslide twin-wire arc-sprayed cylinder linings for vastly reduced internal friction. By returning to the perfect primary and secondary balance of a straight-six, Mercedes completely eliminated the heavy, parasitic balance shafts required in their older V6 diesels.",
