      "pistonSpeed": "15.8 m/s @ 4500 RPM. The OM654M utilizes advanced stepped-bowl forged steel pistons rather than aluminum, offering immense thermal stability and structural strength under high boost.",
      "alternator": "Integrated 48V ISG Gen 2 (No traditional 12V alternator).",
      "rotatingAssembly": { "pistonConstruction": "Heavy-duty forged steel pistons with an advanced stepped-bowl design.", "wristPinDiameter": "28 mm.", "connectingRodLength": "143 mm.", "crankMainJournal": "60.0 mm.", "rodRatio": "1.65" },
