      "oilAndCooling": { "oilSquirters": "Yes, dedicated high-pressure jets target the internal cooling galleries of the steel pistons.", "oilPumpType": "Advanced fully variable displacement vane pump.", "thermostatOpening": "90°C (Electronically mapped).", "oilCooler": "Massive high-flow water-to-oil heat exchanger." },
