      "injectionType": "Common-Rail Direct Injection (CDI) operating at an absolutely staggering 2,700 bar pressure via highly precise Piezo injectors. This extreme pressure pushes the boundaries of diesel technology, ensuring phenomenal fuel atomization but making the fuel system terrifyingly sensitive to poor-quality diesel.",
      "engineLifespan": "250 000 - 450 000+ km. The core architecture of the OM654M, with its longer stroke and steel pistons, is incredibly strong. However, the true lifespan is entirely dictated by the continuous maintenance of its incredibly complex 48V ISG mild-hybrid system, the fragile valvetrain, and the Euro 6d emissions peripherals.",
      "turboType": "Single Variable Nozzle Turbine (VNT) with water cooling. Utilizes a highly advanced variable-geometry turbocharger specifically tailored to integrate seamlessly with the electric torque-fill of the 48V ISG. This eliminates turbo lag entirely and provides a relentless 440 Nm torque curve.",
      "ecuType": "Bosch MD1 heavily integrated with the 48V Hybrid Control Module. The system seamlessly juggles the 200 Nm electric torque fill, aggressive engine start/stop cycles, and full ICE power. It responds to software tuning, though limits are dictated by the ISG integration.",
