      "maxPowerStockInternals": "280+ hp. The incredibly robust aluminum block, combined with heavy-duty forged steel pistons, is massively over-engineered. The engine handles significant boost increases effortlessly, with tuning limits dictated strictly by the 48V ISG electronics and transmission clutches.",
