        "AdBlue No-Start Immobilization Countdown: If the main engine computer detects any fault within the strictly regulated Euro 6d SCR emissions system, it immediately initiates a hard, irreversible dashboard countdown. Once the permitted miles reach zero, the ECU completely immobilizes the vehicle.",
        "Engine-Out Timing Chain Replacement Cost: Because the timing chain drive is located at the absolute rear of the engine block, access is virtually impossible while the engine is in the car. If the chain stretches and threatens to jump teeth, mechanics must completely remove the transmission assembly.",
        "DPF Fatal Blockage from Urban Use: The OM654M requires extremely hot exhaust temperatures for extended periods to perform active regeneration cycles. If the vehicle is used strictly for short city commutes, the DPF will become fatally blocked with dense soot.",
        "Catastrophic Injector Hydrolock: The 2700-bar Piezo direct injectors work under immense, industry-leading pressure and can stick completely open if contaminated. Raw liquid diesel fuel rapidly fills the combustion chamber, causing a violent hydrolock that instantly bends the forged connecting rod."
